Fonts from www.larabiefonts.com for Debian
------------------

The author of Larabie Fonts, Ray Larabie, kindly licenced his
Freeware Fonts under a almost-completely-free licence.
(Derivative works are restricted and name changes are not allowed)

Please visit his page and have a look at the professional versions
of his fonts: http://www.larabiefonts.com/deluxe.html

If you use his fonts, be so kind and donate to him.
http://www.larabiefonts.com/donation.html

See the included READ_ME.TXT for details.

The fonts are split into three packages, sorted by me. Please send me
suggestions for better sorting / grouping the fonts.

 -- Erich Schubert <erich@debian.org>, Sun, 16 Dec 2001 16:11:40 +0100
